// Title: Misc Cloud Suspicious Api
// Description: Hunts for misc cloud suspicious api
// MITRE ATT&CK: T1078.004
// Severity: informational
// FalsePositives:
//   - Aktivitas cloud admin / automation legit (CI/CD, IaC).
CloudEvents | where ActionType in ('ListUsers', 'GetPolicies') and UserAgent contains 'curl'
